        "name": "Crushing Blow",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Wukong's next attack gains attack range, deals bonus damage, and reduces the target's armor for a few seconds.",
        "bodyHtml": "Wukong and his <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Clone's</span> next Attack gains 135/145/155/165/175 range, deals an additional <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(20/45/70/95/120 + ([[si:scalead]]50% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span>, and removes <span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">10/15/20/25/30% Armor</span> for 3 seconds.<br /><br />This Ability's cooldown is reduced by 0.5 seconds every time Wukong or his <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Clone</span> hit an enemy with an Attack or Ability.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">This Ability triggers spell effects upon dealing damage.</span>",
