        "bodyHtml": "Wukong dashes to an enemy, sending out <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Clones</span> that mimic the dash to up to 2 additional enemies nearby. Each enemy struck takes <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(80/120/160/200/240 + ([[si:scaleap]]100% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>. He and his <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Clone</span> gain <span>40/45/50/55/60% Attack Speed</span> for 5 seconds.<br /><br />",
