        "bodyHtml": "Wukong gains <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">20% Move Speed</span> and spins his staff, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocking Up</span> nearby enemies for 0.6 seconds and take <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(275% Attack Damage) plus 8/12/16% max Health physical damage</span> over 2 seconds.<br /><br />This Ability can be cast a second time within 8 seconds before going on cooldown.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Damage to jungle monsters is capped at <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">1200 damage</span> over 2 seconds.</span>",
